# Phase MG1: public rendering of derivation rules

**Status: r1 draft, awaiting owner review.** Plan approval and this spec's
owner gate are both still open. No code is written before the gate.

## Provenance

- Plan: [model-growth-guardrails-plan.md](model-growth-guardrails-plan.md) r1,
  §2.1 and §4 MG1.
- Source: [issue #72](https://github.com/vasiloglou/gnd-public/issues/72)
  (GR-T9 in the reporter's numbering).
- Inspection baseline: `1446f90` (main after PR #79).
- No review has read these bytes.

